{"object":"Keycaps are replaceable wear items, PBT is described as harder and long-wearing, and doubleshot legends cannot fade or be removed even as the keycap wears. These facts can reduce legend-wear risk but do not establish switch, cable, socket, controller, or PCB longevity.","predicate":"are_serviceable_under","source_url":"http://localhost:8090/content/wikipedia_en_all_nopic/Keycap","subject":"keycap wear and replacement","text":"Keycaps can be replaced; PBT is harder and long-wearing; and doubleshot legends do not fade even as caps wear, so legend wear is separable from whole-board failure.","title":"prop_keycap_serviceability"}